交媒体发表长文，直言共和党之所以落败“是因为这场战争”，并批评了政府在选前的宣传策略。起初，川...&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/11/18/126840763.html?v=1795041850</guid><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:44:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美联储理事再提加息50点：必要时需“震惊市场”</title><link>https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/11/18/126840803.html?v=1795041850</link><description>&lt;p&gt;抓取被服务器拒绝&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/11/18/126840803.html?v=1795041850</guid><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:44:12 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>